            "text": "究竟 strengthens a real question about an unresolved matter. Keep the question word or affirmative-negative form in its ordinary place.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "你究竟要什么？",
                "pinyin": "nǐ jiūjìng yào shénme ？",
                "meaning": "What exactly do you want?",
